@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-56 - View Coupons List

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Settings UI" as FE
control "CouponsController" as API
control "CouponsService" as Service
database "MongoDB: coupons" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-56
FE -> API: GET /coupons
API -> Service: Execute View Coupons List
Service -> DB: Read/write coupons
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Danh sách coupons hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đăng nhập với role admin/manager
Post: Danh sách coupons hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào /admin/coupons
2. System gọi API GET /coupons
3. System trả về: code, discount, validFrom, validTo, isActive, usageCount
end note
@enduml
